  "recipeCuisine": "France",
  "name": "Velouté de Poisson",
  "text": "Velouté de Poisson\n\nPreparation time: 5 minutes\n\nCooking time: 60 minutes\n\nYield: 600 ml\n\nIngredients\n\n60 g butter,\n\n4 tbsp plain flour,\n\n1 l fumet de poisson,\n\n100 g chopped mushroom stalks,\n\ndouble cream to taste,\n\nsalt & pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Melt the butter, stir in the flour and cook it for 1 minute, stirring frequently.\n\n2. Meanwhile heat the fumet to boiling point.\n\n3. Pur the fumet over the roux gradually, off the heat, using a whisk to make the sauce as smooth as possible.\n\n4. Add the mushroom stalks and bring back to boiling point.\n\n5. Lower the heat or use a bain marie, and reduce by half (about 45 minutes), whisking in any skin that forms on top.\n\n6. Add cream until the taste and consistency is right.\n\n7. Season to taste.",
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
